@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam defaultFontColor #1e293b
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam arrowColor #2563eb
skinparam arrowThickness 2
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #f8fafc
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #fffbeb
skinparam NoteBorderColor #f59e0b
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #94a3b8
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #f8fafc

title licensedManifest: 清单与 License 合并链路

participant "Research Client\nnfmsl.py / MslClient" as C
participant "Widevine CDM" as CDM
participant "MSL Builder\nCBOR + crypto" as MSL
participant "Netflix MSL Server" as N
participant "Manifest Result" as R

== Precondition ==
C -> N : MSL Key Exchange
N --> C : MasterToken + session keys / key ids
C -> C : User auth\nUIT or HTTP cookie context

== Step 1: License Challenge ==
C -> CDM : getKeyRequest(PSSH / initData)
CDM --> C : challenge bytes

== Step 2: Build Payload ==
C -> MSL : build licensedManifest payload\nviewableId + profiles + drmType=widevine\nchallengeBase64
MSL -> MSL : CBOR encode headerdata\nGZIP payload if needed
MSL -> MSL : AES-CBC encrypt\nHMAC-SHA256 sign

== Step 3: Send ==
MSL -> N : POST encrypted MSL message\nmastertoken + header envelope + payload chunk
N -> N : verify HMAC\ncheck token binding\nparse payload
N --> MSL : encrypted MSL response

== Step 4: Decode ==
MSL -> MSL : verify + decrypt + decompress
MSL --> C : JSON result
C -> R : extract video_tracks\naudio_tracks\nlicense response

== Step 5: Install / Verify ==
alt Android playback
  C -> CDM : provideKeyResponse(license)
  CDM --> C : content keys installed internally
else Python research verification
  C -> C : parse license with local CDM\nrecord KID:key in lab notes
end

note over C,N #fffbeb
  这条链路的关键不是单独请求 license,
  而是把 Widevine challenge 放进 MSL payload,
  让 manifest、license、CDN profile 在同一条已认证通道里返回。
end note

@enduml
